<title>CANADA: Avenor says to proceed with divestments.</title>
<headline>Avenor says to proceed with divestments.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Avenor Inc said on Wednesday it would proceed with its previously announced plan to seek buyers for its 53 percent stake in Pacific Forest Products Ltd and to divest its Gold River pulp mill in British Columbia.</p>
<p>Earlier today, Avenor shareholders rejected the company's proposed C$2.6 billion acquisition of Repap Enterprises Inc.</p>
<p>((Montreal Reuters Bureau 514-985-2434))</p>
</text>
